WEBVTT

00:06.047 --> 00:09.384
It is impossible for the hand
to move faster than the eye.

00:10.051 --> 00:12.637
If someone doesn't have
an eye that can judge quality,

00:12.721 --> 00:16.266
they can never create anything
of value with their hands.

00:16.349 --> 00:19.352
This is a popular saying
within the artistic community.

00:19.978 --> 00:22.522
This can be applied in any industry.

00:22.605 --> 00:24.899
The growth rate of those
who possess this eye

00:24.983 --> 00:28.194
far eclipses the rate of those who do not!

00:42.876 --> 00:45.503
He saw my right hook

00:45.587 --> 00:49.007
and used his left hand
to strike back immediately!

00:49.090 --> 00:51.885
It's an action
that he's unable to do before.

00:51.968 --> 00:53.428
He's growing…

00:54.763 --> 00:56.264
by devouring me!

00:57.932 --> 01:00.602
What a beautiful fall!

01:02.395 --> 01:03.688
His face is defenseless.

01:03.772 --> 01:06.274
I can do it with Divergent Fist!

01:06.357 --> 01:07.942
However…

01:12.030 --> 01:15.158
He caught my fist from gaining momentum
by blocking it with his head!

01:16.826 --> 01:19.996
I want you to devour something else.

01:20.914 --> 01:24.709
Your Divergent Fist is created using
superhuman speed with your cursed energy,

01:24.793 --> 01:30.256
which has a time lag that
Jujutsu Sorcerers usually don't possess.

01:30.340 --> 01:32.050
That's tricky.

01:32.133 --> 01:36.262
An average Jujutsu Sorcerer
would be confused about what happened.

01:36.346 --> 01:40.850
It's also very effective
against opponents, if they are inferior.

01:41.976 --> 01:44.854
But it will be useless
against a Special Grade.

01:45.438 --> 01:47.273
What will you do, my friend?

01:49.234 --> 01:52.904
I will inject a whole lot of
my cursed energy with all my power.

01:52.987 --> 01:54.030
Good!

01:54.114 --> 01:57.450
So why did your cursed energy get delayed?

01:57.534 --> 02:00.787
That's because
your cursed energy is flowing!

02:02.622 --> 02:03.706
What?

02:04.374 --> 02:05.291
Wait.

02:05.375 --> 02:08.086
Do you mean I should let it flow faster?

02:08.169 --> 02:09.921
Letting your cursed energy flow

02:10.004 --> 02:13.550
is something
many Jujutsu Sorcerers do consciously.

02:14.134 --> 02:17.762
Thoughts like "I'm mad"
or "I'm boiling with anger."

02:17.846 --> 02:20.140
In theory, cursed energy
from negative emotions

02:20.223 --> 02:23.643
starts to flow from the belly button
to the whole body.

02:23.726 --> 02:24.561
CURSED ENERGY

02:24.644 --> 02:26.813
From the belly button into the chest,

02:26.896 --> 02:31.067
cursed energy flows through
the shoulders, arms, and fist.

02:31.151 --> 02:36.573
The consciousness of distinguishing
body parts delays the cursed energy.

02:37.157 --> 02:40.577
The idea of letting
cursed energy flow is not wrong.

02:40.660 --> 02:41.995
But it's just the first step.

02:42.078 --> 02:44.914
You can't get stuck within this thought.

02:44.998 --> 02:46.624
The better a Jujutsu Sorcerer,

02:46.708 --> 02:49.085
the harder it is to predict
their cursed energy flow.

02:49.669 --> 02:52.255
For a different reason than you.

02:52.839 --> 02:55.258
Do we think with our stomachs?

02:55.341 --> 02:58.261
Do we get angry with our heads?

02:58.928 --> 03:00.847
Listen here, Itadori.

03:12.483 --> 03:17.155
We exist in this world
with our entire body and soul.

03:17.739 --> 03:21.242
Most people have taken
that maxim for granted.

03:26.748 --> 03:28.917
Thanks, Todo.

03:30.460 --> 03:33.421
I think I understand it now.

03:34.464 --> 03:35.757
I guess…

03:35.840 --> 03:37.383
there's no more need for words.

03:38.051 --> 03:39.928
I won't show mercy!

03:45.433 --> 03:48.478
I'll try my best to guide you!

03:49.187 --> 03:50.730
Don't die, Itadori.

03:50.813 --> 03:52.315
Climb up.

03:52.398 --> 03:53.900
Climb to new heights!

05:28.077 --> 05:29.537
Hey, you.

05:29.620 --> 05:33.624
The old man in Kyoto School
asked you to kill Itadori, right?

05:34.375 --> 05:36.294
This girl has good instincts.

05:36.878 --> 05:40.048
No, it must be Panda.

05:40.131 --> 05:42.216
What are you talking about?

05:42.300 --> 05:44.469
You don't need to hide it.

05:44.552 --> 05:46.679
I'll fight you like I mean to kill you.

05:46.763 --> 05:51.142
Especially Mai, that Maki knockoff.

05:51.225 --> 05:52.393
What?

05:52.477 --> 05:54.562
What's that?

05:54.645 --> 05:58.024
Even Pepper's response
is more decent than yours.

05:58.107 --> 06:00.151
What's this? She's not mad?

06:00.735 --> 06:03.154
I feel the same!

06:03.237 --> 06:07.533
Speaking of which, your team has a Pepper.

06:07.617 --> 06:11.037
Shall I turn him
into a pile of scrap and dump it?

06:13.581 --> 06:14.791
She's scary.

06:19.712 --> 06:20.838
Panda!

06:23.257 --> 06:26.219
He's a Cursed Corpse. He won't die.

06:26.302 --> 06:28.387
He's just temporarily immobilized.

06:30.056 --> 06:32.850
So who are you calling Pepper?

06:32.934 --> 06:35.561
Wait, Mechamaru.

06:37.688 --> 06:41.234
I will give this first-year student
a cute lesson

06:41.317 --> 06:43.236
on Mai's hardships

06:43.319 --> 06:45.822
and what it means to live
as a female Jujutsu Sorcerer.

06:45.905 --> 06:47.740
I'll teach her well.

06:48.449 --> 06:49.492
Just joking.

06:49.575 --> 06:50.785
What?

06:55.164 --> 06:56.541
Do you like attention?

06:56.624 --> 06:59.335
You should have just hid at the back
and supported her.

06:59.418 --> 07:01.629
Well, let's get along…

07:01.712 --> 07:03.506
since we're both the same.

07:04.382 --> 07:06.259
You're just a mere puppet.

07:12.265 --> 07:13.933
What do you know?

07:16.519 --> 07:17.728
Gosh.

07:17.812 --> 07:20.231
I thought we were supposed to hunt curses.

07:21.566 --> 07:22.859
Sword Option.

07:25.736 --> 07:27.488
Boost On.

07:34.829 --> 07:36.956
Ultra Spin!

07:47.049 --> 07:48.885
Cheeky runner.

07:48.968 --> 07:51.137
I really need to finish him off quickly

07:51.220 --> 07:53.723
or run away to go help Nobara,

07:53.806 --> 07:56.058
but he has ranged weapons.

07:56.142 --> 07:59.854
We have no information about
Mechamaru, Nishimiya, and Miwa.

08:00.354 --> 08:01.856
You're quite strong.

08:01.939 --> 08:03.357
What's your grade?

08:04.275 --> 08:06.194
GRADE 1, SEMI-GRADE 1
GRADE 2, SEMI-GRADE 2

08:06.277 --> 08:08.404
This is my guess.

08:08.488 --> 08:10.865
So this might be a little hard for Nobara.

08:10.948 --> 08:14.535
I don't think it's necessary to know
my grade in this situation,

08:14.619 --> 08:16.329
but I'll tell you.

08:18.122 --> 08:19.665
I'm a Semi-Grade 1.

08:20.625 --> 08:22.919
-What?
-Ultra Cannon!

08:24.587 --> 08:26.088
His range of attack is wide.

08:34.639 --> 08:38.559
It's cooling down. It's a big move
that needs time to charge and recover!

08:38.643 --> 08:43.189
Given my firepower,
I have to pinpoint its core.

08:43.981 --> 08:45.316
Cursed Corpse.

08:45.900 --> 08:48.361
It refers to a generic name
for a nonliving thing

08:48.444 --> 08:51.656
that hosts a curse
and can act autonomously.

08:52.323 --> 08:57.370
An artificial Cursed Corpse
has a core in place of a heart.

09:03.334 --> 09:07.421
Created by Masamichi Yaga,
the leading sorcerer in Puppetry Jujutsu,

09:07.505 --> 09:10.383
Panda is my greatest masterpiece.

09:10.466 --> 09:13.094
It's a Cursed Corpse born with emotions.

09:22.645 --> 09:25.147
An Abrupt-Mutated Cursed Corpse.

09:25.856 --> 09:29.235
Panda is not a panda!

09:38.869 --> 09:41.038
It's hard to tell
what its next move will be.

09:58.639 --> 10:02.435
Well, I should know if there are
similar Cursed Corpses like me.

10:02.518 --> 10:06.272
I've never heard of any,
so you're not a Cursed Corpse.

10:06.355 --> 10:10.192
You're being controlled remotely
by a Jujutsu Sorcerer.

10:10.276 --> 10:13.821
Even so, don't get angry because
you're treated as a Cursed Corpse.

10:13.904 --> 10:15.656
You don't like being compared to me?

10:16.574 --> 10:18.075
I'll get hurt.

10:18.743 --> 10:21.162
I will really get hurt!

10:22.079 --> 10:24.373
Based on your cursed energy output,

10:24.457 --> 10:27.084
the main body shouldn't be far.

10:27.585 --> 10:29.378
No, it must be right outside the arena.

10:29.962 --> 10:32.173
So it's pointless for me to find it.

10:32.256 --> 10:34.091
No one will be watching you then.

10:34.175 --> 10:36.385
Maybe I should destroy you now.

10:36.469 --> 10:38.888
Neither will come true.

10:39.472 --> 10:42.767
Do you know about
the Heavenly Restriction?

10:42.850 --> 10:46.937
It's different from
the Binding Vow set by oneself.

10:47.021 --> 10:50.816
It's one that's been forced
onto the body since birth.

10:51.317 --> 10:55.112
I was born without
a right arm and both legs,

10:55.196 --> 10:57.782
and I have no sensation below my waist.

10:57.865 --> 11:00.993
My skin is so fragile
that it can't handle moonlight.

11:01.077 --> 11:05.122
My pores feel like
they were pricked by needles.

11:05.206 --> 11:08.876
In return, I was granted
a wide range of cursed techniques…

11:08.959 --> 11:12.296
and cursed energy
that far surpasses others.

11:12.380 --> 11:15.132
This is not the strength I seek.

11:15.216 --> 11:18.511
If my body could be restored
by giving up my cursed techniques,

11:18.594 --> 11:20.054
I would gladly do it.

11:20.638 --> 11:21.764
You see…

11:21.847 --> 11:27.186
I see you walking around casually
under the sun as a Cursed Corpse…

11:27.269 --> 11:30.731
I just can't stand it!

11:32.942 --> 11:34.985
Ultimate Mechamaru!

11:36.153 --> 11:38.656
Mode, Albatross!

11:39.907 --> 11:41.951
What an incredible amount
of cursed energy!

11:42.034 --> 11:43.577
Based on his position…

11:45.413 --> 11:46.872
Nobara will get caught in it!

11:47.456 --> 11:49.458
I have to take it!

11:49.542 --> 11:52.002
Ultimate Cannon!

12:05.433 --> 12:07.143
Is it dead?

12:07.643 --> 12:10.771
No, you're not worthy of…

12:10.855 --> 12:13.858
the concept of death.

12:16.110 --> 12:17.862
While bragging about your misfortune,

12:17.945 --> 12:21.365
you've also disclosed
your cursed technique.

12:21.449 --> 12:24.118
Quite the shrewd Jujutsu Sorcerer.

12:24.201 --> 12:28.122
He's still alive after Ultimate Cannon?

12:32.042 --> 12:34.920
I'm a little irritated now.

12:35.880 --> 12:37.256
What's happening?

12:37.882 --> 12:39.884
That look of yours…

12:39.967 --> 12:41.677
Panda…

12:41.760 --> 12:43.679
is not a panda!

00:12:59.727 --> 00:13:00.853
Panda.

00:13:01.479 --> 00:13:05.316
Actually, you have
an older brother and sister.

00:13:06.692 --> 00:13:08.152
I don't.

00:13:08.235 --> 00:13:09.487
No, you do.

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:11.447
They are in your body.

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:12.948
What's with the honorific?

00:13:13.032 --> 00:13:14.533
In my body?

00:13:14.617 --> 00:13:15.451
Yes.

00:13:15.534 --> 00:13:17.411
One day, you'll understand.

00:13:18.078 --> 00:13:20.164
No matter when…

00:13:21.081 --> 00:13:25.085
They would always be there
to lend you their power.

00:13:27.254 --> 00:13:28.547
Sword Option.

00:13:28.631 --> 00:13:30.466
Ultra Shield!

00:13:38.057 --> 00:13:41.393
Usually, there is only one core
for a Cursed Corpse.

00:13:41.477 --> 00:13:44.146
But there are three cores in my body.

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:47.691
I can transform my body
by replacing the main core.

00:13:49.527 --> 00:13:51.904
My panda core emphasizes balance.

00:13:52.404 --> 00:13:56.075
My brother, gorilla core emphasizes
strength and is good at quick combat.

00:13:56.575 --> 00:13:58.702
And my shy sister.

00:13:59.703 --> 00:14:01.830
My sister's core was hit
by the first shot,

00:14:02.373 --> 00:14:05.251
and my panda core is exhausted
from the attack just now.

00:14:06.001 --> 00:14:08.671
I have no choice
but to use Gorilla Mode to win.

00:14:17.638 --> 00:14:19.974
He's not as powerful as Todo.

00:14:20.057 --> 00:14:21.559
But that palm strike just now…

00:14:22.268 --> 00:14:24.019
It reverberated my insides.

00:14:25.312 --> 00:14:27.690
Despite defending, I'm still injured.

00:14:27.773 --> 00:14:29.483
Did you notice?

00:14:29.567 --> 00:14:32.194
This is Gorilla Mode's ultimate move,

00:14:33.362 --> 00:14:37.032
the Unblockable Drumming Beat!

00:14:37.116 --> 00:14:41.036
If the Unblockable Drumming Beat
strikes my head or chest again,

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:43.789
Mechamaru won't be able to move anymore.

00:14:43.873 --> 00:14:47.960
My right arm and Sword Option
can't be used anymore.

00:14:48.043 --> 00:14:50.546
I can't use Ultimate Cannon either.

00:14:50.629 --> 00:14:55.134
Gorilla Mode consumes cursed energy
quickly since it's a gorilla.

00:14:55.634 --> 00:14:56.802
I must hurry up.

00:14:56.886 --> 00:14:58.762
I've destroyed his right arm.

00:14:58.846 --> 00:15:01.265
He can't use maximum power anymore.

00:15:01.348 --> 00:15:04.059
No sword in his left arm or mouth.
Is only his cannon left?

00:15:04.143 --> 00:15:07.062
Even so, he won't simply use it.

00:15:07.146 --> 00:15:11.567
He thought the two cannon attacks
should have finished me off.

00:15:12.109 --> 00:15:16.238
In fact, two of my cores are crippled.

00:15:16.322 --> 00:15:19.491
I guess he'll aim at my core
at a point-blank range

00:15:19.575 --> 00:15:21.619
and finish me off.

00:15:21.702 --> 00:15:22.703
However…

00:15:29.752 --> 00:15:32.379
I have the advantage in close combat.

00:16:53.168 --> 00:16:54.336
A tile?

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:56.422
Did he just grab that off the roof?

00:17:03.679 --> 00:17:05.681
He uses his boosters after distracting me?

00:17:05.764 --> 00:17:07.307
This guy is very skillful!

00:17:08.392 --> 00:17:10.144
I won't miss this time.

00:17:11.061 --> 00:17:13.856
Its core is right here,
where the cursed energy…

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:15.983
is the strongest!

00:17:23.407 --> 00:17:25.284
You did very well.

00:17:25.367 --> 00:17:27.119
For a puppet, that is.

00:17:29.913 --> 00:17:30.789
What?

00:17:30.873 --> 00:17:33.709
Don't compare me to other Cursed Corpses.

00:17:33.792 --> 00:17:37.046
I can fake my core's location
by concentrating my cursed energy.

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:40.340
After all, I was faking
my core's quantity all along.

00:17:52.561 --> 00:17:54.605
You lost because…

00:17:54.688 --> 00:17:56.732
you've underestimated a puppet!

00:17:57.316 --> 00:18:01.737
I also never considered myself
to be the same as the humans around me.

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:05.783
So I guess I can understand you
in that sense.

00:18:06.575 --> 00:18:10.496
But I've never envied human beings.

00:18:10.579 --> 00:18:11.747
What?

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:14.333
Because humans are gross!

00:18:16.919 --> 00:18:20.798
They risk their lives
to achieve their goals.

00:18:20.881 --> 00:18:23.634
Sometimes they act all decisive
and then indecisive later.

00:18:23.717 --> 00:18:24.927
I don't get them.

00:18:25.552 --> 00:18:29.348
But I like them
because they possess qualities I don't.

00:18:29.431 --> 00:18:30.724
Although it's gross.

00:18:31.809 --> 00:18:34.436
It's not easy for you either, right?

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:38.190
But that doesn't mean
the one who has it hard is always right.

00:18:38.273 --> 00:18:41.443
In fact, I'm not your enemy.

00:18:41.527 --> 00:18:43.904
Why are you a Jujutsu Sorcerer?

00:18:43.987 --> 00:18:46.115
Is there nothing else to do?

00:18:46.615 --> 00:18:48.700
I don't really care,

00:18:49.952 --> 00:18:54.498
but if you have any wish,
I'll help you fulfill it.

00:18:58.252 --> 00:18:59.211
Mechamaru.

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:02.089
Don't waste your big moves.

00:19:02.172 --> 00:19:05.217
There may be more than
one enemy in front of you.

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.970
Mechamaru.

00:19:08.053 --> 00:19:10.764
If you can't instantly answer
the type of woman you like,

00:19:10.848 --> 00:19:13.725
don't think about being
a full-fledged Jujutsu Sorcerer.

00:19:13.809 --> 00:19:15.227
Mechamaru.

00:19:15.310 --> 00:19:18.188
This is a present
in place of obligatory chocolates.

00:19:18.272 --> 00:19:21.108
I heard that you like Evolta AA batteries.

00:19:21.191 --> 00:19:22.609
I don't eat that.

00:19:22.693 --> 00:19:23.735
What?

00:19:23.819 --> 00:19:25.195
But Mai said…

00:19:27.739 --> 00:19:29.241
Someday…

00:19:45.716 --> 00:19:49.094
I want to be with everyone.

00:19:50.429 --> 00:19:51.638
What?

00:19:51.722 --> 00:19:52.848
Pardon?

00:19:52.931 --> 00:19:57.728
Will you still help me
after seeing my true form?

00:19:57.811 --> 00:19:58.854
What?

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:03.567
I have no right to be picky
about appearances.

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:05.027
I'm a panda.

00:20:07.571 --> 00:20:08.447
See you.

00:20:09.031 --> 00:20:11.241
Let me visit you next time.

00:20:15.704 --> 00:20:17.664
Shut up, you darn puppet.

00:20:23.629 --> 00:20:24.922
I almost forgot!

00:20:25.005 --> 00:20:26.006
What?

00:20:28.592 --> 00:20:29.885
Lend me your phone.

00:20:29.968 --> 00:20:33.430
KYOTO SISTER-SCHOOL GOODWILL EVENT
TEAM BATTLE, MECHAMARU WITHDRAWS

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:41.438
Are you serious?

00:20:41.521 --> 00:20:43.315
This person…

00:20:43.398 --> 00:20:45.317
She's crazy strong!

00:22:16.783 --> 00:22:18.452
Juju Stroll.

00:22:21.038 --> 00:22:25.834
Mechamaru, tell Noritoshi
that Ms. Utahime is looking for him.

00:22:26.501 --> 00:22:31.214
Mechamaru, help me give this to Todo.

00:22:31.715 --> 00:22:34.259
Mechamaru, I'm glad you're here!

00:22:34.343 --> 00:22:37.387
Help me give this to Todo and Kamo.

00:22:39.973 --> 00:22:43.935
Why do you guys always ask me for help?

00:22:46.772 --> 00:22:49.024
Don't talk to me right now.

00:22:49.608 --> 00:22:52.819
Takada is streaming live now.

00:22:54.237 --> 00:22:57.949
"Ibaragi"? It's Ibaraki.

00:22:58.033 --> 00:22:59.993
You don't even know this?

00:23:01.286 --> 00:23:04.456
Obviously, it's because
we don't want trouble.

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:11.963
I'm still afraid of them.

00:23:13.799 --> 00:23:18.512
If we say that,
he might not help us anymore.

00:23:20.263 --> 00:23:21.556
Mechamaru.

00:23:21.640 --> 00:23:22.641
What?

00:23:24.267 --> 00:23:25.727
We're counting on you!

00:23:25.811 --> 00:23:26.645
Good.

00:23:28.230 --> 00:23:31.233
All right, it's time for our assignments!

00:23:31.316 --> 00:23:33.860
No, tell me the reason…

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:39.866
Never mind.

00:23:40.367 --> 00:23:42.077
Since they are counting on me,

00:23:42.702 --> 00:23:43.995
it's not too bad after all.
